※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4578

※ One field, one value.  Two would be a value whose meaning depended on which of
※ them the compiler chose, and there is no reading of it that is not a guess
※ about what was meant.

type Point = x : u32 ; y : u32

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let p : Point = Point(.x ← 1u32, .y ← 2u32, .x ← 3u32)
    if p.x = 1u32: 0u6 else: 1u6
